WEBVTT

00:24:28.710 --> 00:24:32.574
And it's that complete sense
of social equality and moral equality

00:24:32.598 --> 00:24:36.454
that drives these people, and I think
they're part of the repair of our country.

00:24:36.825 --> 00:24:40.645
(Music)

00:24:56.044 --> 00:24:59.985
CA: You've written about
just how rabidly partisan we are